    "title": "Titan Slayer : Action Idle RPG",
    "description": "\u25b6Titans have invaded! \r\n\r\nWe need you to defend the Arsenal Continent!\r\nUse the power of the Titans against them!\r\nEmbark on a journey with legendary heroes who answer your call.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Hack and slash battle with powerful skills\r\n-Try using various powerful skills to defeat the Titans.\r\n-You can battle strategically through dozens of skills.\r\n\r\n\u25b6Squad Battle with Legendary Heroes\r\n-Enjoy the battlefield with dozens of remarkable heroes\r\n-Battle strategically using each hero\u2019s unique skills and characteristics.\r\n\r\n\u25b6World content with users around the world\r\n-Experience a new level of world system that goes beyond idle combat\r\n-You can battle and cooperate with your guild members in a huge world.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u25b6Titans have invaded! <br><br>We need you to defend the Arsenal Continent!<br>Use the power of the Titans against them!<br>Embark on a journey with legendary heroes who answer your call.<br><br>\u25b6Hack and slash battle with powerful skills<br>-Try using various powerful skills to defeat the Titans.<br>-You can battle strategically through dozens of skills.<br><br>\u25b6Squad Battle with Legendary Heroes<br>-Enjoy the battlefield with dozens of remarkable heroes<br>-Battle strategically using each hero\u2019s unique skills and characteristics.<br><br>\u25b6World content with users around the world<br>-Experience a new level of world system that goes beyond idle combat<br>-You can battle and cooperate with your guild members in a huge world.",
